## Production Dependencies

Production runtime dependencies bundled into or shipped with `@tk-reawakened/*` packages have their copyright notices and license texts recorded below.

`@tk-reawakened/runner-headless` and `@tk-reawakened/runner-harness` have no production runtime npm dependencies of their own beyond their workspace packages.

### fflate 0.8.3 — MIT

A dependency of `@tk-reawakened/core`, which imports only the `fflate/browser` subpath and only its synchronous APIs (AD-6). It decompresses the zlib/deflate streams inside PNG image data (`decodeTexture`, format-spec §10) and, in the package reader, inside `.tpk`/ZIP archives (format-spec §13).

